{"seq":1,"slug":"engineering-management","title":"工程管理","stage":"DONE","category":"management","chapterCount":5,"docCount":30,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-management","rating":{"composite":4.28,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":4,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.57,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"工程管理-简介\">工程管理 简介</h1><p>工程管理是将技术能力转化为持续交付业务价值的系统性方法论。它不仅仅是写代码——更是关于如何组建高效团队、如何在不确定性中推进项目、如何帮助工程师成长、如何在速度与质量之间找到平衡，以及如何设计能够支撑业务规模化的组织架构。优秀的工程管理者既要深谙技术本质，又要理解人性与组织运作的底层逻辑。</p>\n<p>本知识库面向正在或即将承担管理职责的技术人员。无论你是第一次带团队的 Tech Lead、正在从 IC 转型为 Engineering Manager 的资深工程师，还是希望系统化提升管理能力的技术总监，这里都将为你提供从团队建设到组织设计的完整知识框架。</p>\n<p>全书共分五个章节，覆盖工程管理的核心领域：</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>团队建设</strong>从招聘面试、工程师入职、团队拓扑模式到文化价值观建设，帮助你掌握从零组建和塑造高效工程团队的系统方法。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>项目管理</strong>聚焦工程项目的全生命周期管理，涵盖估算与规划、敏捷方法论、风险管理以及干系人沟通，让你能够在复杂环境中可靠地交付成果。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>人员管理</strong>深入一对一沟通、反馈框架、绩效评估和职业阶梯设计，这些是帮助团队成员持续成长、保持高效能的核心管理实践。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>技术债务与质量</strong>围绕技术债务的分类治理、重构策略、代码评审文化和事故管理展开，帮助你在快速迭代的同时守住工程质量的底线。</p>\n<p>第五章<strong>组织设计</strong>讨论团队结构模式、跨团队协作、决策框架和工程组织的规模化，为你提供从团队到组织层面的架构设计思路。</p>\n<p>建议按照章节顺序学习，因为后续章节建立在前置概念之上。如果你已有团队管理经验，可以直接跳到最关心的章节；如果你刚刚开始管理之路，建议从第一章团队建设和第三章人员管理入手。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"team-building","title":"团队建设","docCount":5,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-management/team-building","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hiring-and-interviewing","title":"招聘与面试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-management/team-building/hiring-and-interviewing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"onboarding-engineers","title":"工程师入职","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-management/team-building/onboarding-engineers"},{"seq":3,"slug":"team-topology-patterns","title":"团队拓扑模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-management/team-building/team-topology-patterns"},{"seq":4,"slug":"culture-and-values","title":"文化与价值观","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-management/team-building/culture-and-values"},{"seq":5,"slug":"culture-building-and-evolution","title":"文化建设与文化演进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-management/team-building/culture-building-and-evolution"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"project-management","title":"项目管理","docCount":8,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-management/project-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"estimation-and-planning","title":"评估与规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-management/project-management/estimation-and-planning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"planning-practices","title":"规划实践与滚动规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-management/project-management/planning-practices"},{"seq":3,"slug":"agile-scrum-kanban","title":"Agile、Scrum 与 Kanban","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-management/project-management/agile-scrum-kanban"},{"seq":4,"slug":"kanban-and-framework-choice","title":"Kanban 与框架选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-management/project-management/kanban-and-framework-choice"},{"seq":5,"slug":"risk-management","title":"风险管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-management/project-management/risk-management"},{"seq":6,"slug":"risk-register-and-playbook","title":"风险登记册与应对示例","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-management/project-management/risk-register-and-playbook"},{"seq":7,"slug":"stakeholder-communication","title":"干系人沟通","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-management/project-management/stakeholder-communication"},{"seq":8,"slug":"communication-execution","title":"沟通执行：变更、冲突与远程协作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-management/project-management/communication-execution"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"people-management","title":"人员管理","docCount":7,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-management/people-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"one-on-ones","title":"一对一会议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-management/people-management/one-on-ones"},{"seq":2,"slug":"